        "expression": "let wobble = sin(p.x * 3.0 + t * 0.4) * 0.05;\nvar acc = vec3<f32>(0.0, 0.0, 0.0);\nfor (var i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n    let k = f32(i);\n    let f = k / 5.0;\n    let phase = k * 0.9 + t * wave_speed * (0.6 + 0.15 * k);\n    let amp = wave_amp * 0.25 * (1.0 - 0.12 * k);\n    let y = (f - 0.5) * 0.8 + amp * sin(p.x * wave_density * (1.0 + 0.25 * k) + phase) + wobble * f;\n    let d = abs(p.y - y);\n    let trace = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.008, d);\n    let halo_glow = exp(-d * 26.0) * 0.5;\n    let col = select(mix(c1, c3, f * 2.0), mix(c3, c2, f * 2.0 - 1.0), f > 0.5);\n    acc += col * (trace * 1.3 + halo_glow);\n}\nlet scan = 0.12 * smoothstep(0.6, 1.0, 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(p.y * 140.0));\nlet haze = c4 * (0.5 + 0.5 * sin(p.x * 4.0 + t * 0.5)) * 0.6;\nlet color = tonemap(acc + haze + c5 * scan);\nreturn mix(bg, color, strength);",
